  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\nAllison St & 5300 Block (#34947) (eastbound)\r\nW 55th Ave & Zephyr Ct (#34949) (eastbound)\r\nW 55th Ave & Olde Wadsworth Blvd (#34952) (westbound)\r\nW 55th Ave & Zephyr Ct (#34950) (westbound)\r\nAllison St & 5300 Block (#34948) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 72 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 52nd Ave & Carr St (#34943)\r\nOlde Town Arvada Stn Gate B (#34535)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 72 get on/off buses at:\r\nOlde Town Arvada Stn Gate F (#34539)\r\nW 52nd Ave & Allison St (#34946)"
